    description: "DEEP bakeoff: interface dispatch creates N×N cross-product edges between all implementations. E.g., alertmanager Integration.Notify has 325 dispatches_to edges creating full mesh between Notifier.Notify implementations. Reverse slices show every impl pointing to every other impl instead of showing actual callers. Should show callers of interface method, not peer-to-peer edges."  # 9782
