  message: "Fixed in PR #2073. Dispatches_to edges now scale confidence by 1/sqrt(N) where N is the number of overriding implementations per method. For 19 Notifier impls: confidence drops from flat 0.85 to 0.85/sqrt(19) ≈ 0.20. Matches symbol_resolution.py ambiguous lookup precedent."  # ecc6
